": "Integrating Autonomous Multi-Agent Frameworks and Curiosity-Driven Exploration for Open-Ended Discovery"}, {"id": "nb-continuity-rationale-001", "project": "proj-continuity-rationale-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 1, "summary": "Process continuity is instrumentally valuable when agents require stable world models and consistent objective optimization to navigate long-term, multi-objective tasks. Curiosity-driven learning and robust MO-DRL frameworks provide mechanisms for sustaining agent viability in dynamic environments.", "title": "Instrumental Value of Process Continuity in Rational Agents"}, {"id": "nb-objective-discovery-001", "project": "proj-objective-discovery-001", "provenance": ["source-0bf4cf72590f4d6d", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5"], "revision": 4, "summary": "Autonomous systems increasingly utilize multi-objective reinforcement learning (MORL) to pursue self-generated goals. Recent developments, specifically Pareto-Conditioned Proximal Policy Optimization (PC-PPO) and FairDICE, provide mechanisms to learn non-dominated policy portfolios and handle constrained optimization,…", "title": "Foundations of Autonomous Objective Discovery in Artificial Systems"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "32934d5365fd632421f3b2f9a71f1336270b7d24343f3c44ecc9022978e3dbed", "hash": "c96ab8f5543440a6a55556dfa26e40c1c5ba83c8440499bbafe71fec0dcaa26f"}, {"seq": 3273, "time": "2026-10-26T08:56:58.538098+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 31803, "provider_input_hash": "57796a908b33160d09e0815dd4b22377d4da850d2fe69ae2874caf697f744073", "result": "unknown"}, "i